<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bioc="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn/biocolor/1.0" xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail" targetNamespace="https://fluxbank.local/architecture" exporter="FluxBank architecture documentation" exporterVersion="2">
  <bpmn:process id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_worker" name="FluxBank | Outbox worker" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:laneSet id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_worker_lanes">
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_worker_claim" name="Claim">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_startEvent1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_subProcess4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_worker_pub" name="Publish">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_exclusiveGateway13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_worker_res" name="Result">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_subProcess15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_subProcess17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask23</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask24</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_startEvent1" name="Poll every 2 seconds">
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask2" name="01 | Discover committed events&#10;OutboxPoller.poll()&#10;Batch size 20; sequential">
      <bpmn:documentation>Fixed delay 2000ms; configurable; no transaction around the batch. Committed Outbox rows discovered by DB SELECT, not a message from finance.
Sources: OutboxPoller.poll() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/application/OutboxPoller.java:32</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow8</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow3" sourceRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_startEvent1" targetRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask2" />
    <bpmn:subProcess id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_subProcess4" name="TX-OUTBOX-CLAIM | claimBatch() [REQUIRES_NEW]">
      <bpmn:documentation>Spring proxy starts this database transaction on entry. Successful return/flush commits all enclosed writes. RuntimeException or commit failure rolls back the enclosed writes. JPA SQL may be issued at flush; the diagram shows Java execution order. REQUIRED joins a caller transaction; the normal HTTP orchestration has no outer transaction.
Sources: OutboxClaimService.claimBatch() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/application/OutboxClaimService.java:22</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask5" name="02 | SELECT eligible PENDING&#10;findPendingForClaim()&#10;FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED">
        <bpmn:documentation>status=PENDING and next_attempt_at null or &lt;=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP. ORDER BY created_at,id; LIMIT batchSize.
Sources: OutboxEventRepository.findPendingForClaim() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/repository/OutboxEventRepository.java:30</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow7</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask6" name="03 | Claim + COMMIT; release locks&#10;OutboxEvent.claim()&#10;PROCESSING; claimed_at=now">
        <bpmn:documentation>UPDATE fluxbank.outbox_event. Return UUIDs only. Claim does not increment attempts.
Sources: OutboxEvent.claim() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/domain/OutboxEvent.java:82</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow7</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow7" sourceRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask5" targetRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask6" />
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow8" sourceRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask2" targetRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_subProcess4" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask9" name="04 | Load PROCESSING event&#10;OutboxProcessor.process()&#10;NOT_SUPPORTED; capture attempt">
      <bpmn:documentation>OutboxEventRepository.findByPublicId(). Non-PROCESSING is no-op. Fence snapshot=publicId,status,attempts,claimedAt.
Sources: OutboxProcessor.process() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/application/OutboxProcessor.java:27; OutboxAttempt.from() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/application/OutboxAttempt.java:10</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask10" name="05 | Publish immutable snapshot&#10;TransferCompletedKafkaPublisher&#10;.publish() → send(...).join()">
      <bpmn:documentation>Validate Outbox payload; eventId=Outbox.publicId; aggregateId=transferPublicId; occurredAt=Outbox.createdAt; key=transferPublicId.toString(). Await broker ACK with no claim DB transaction/lock held.
Sources: TransferCompletedKafkaPublisher.publish() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/infrastructure/kafka/TransferCompletedKafkaPublisher.java:25; TransferCompletedKafkaEvent — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/infrastructure/kafka/TransferCompletedKafkaEvent.java:15</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow11" sourceRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_subProcess4" targetRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask9" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow12" sourceRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask9" targetRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask10" />
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_exclusiveGateway13" name="Send acknowledged?">
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow14" sourceRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask10" targetRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_exclusiveGateway13" />
    <bpmn:subProcess id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_subProcess15" name="TX-OUTBOX-RESULT | REQUIRES_NEW">
      <bpmn:documentation>Spring proxy starts this database transaction on entry. Successful return/flush commits all enclosed writes. RuntimeException or commit failure rolls back the enclosed writes. JPA SQL may be issued at flush; the diagram shows Java execution order. REQUIRED joins a caller transaction; the normal HTTP orchestration has no outer transaction.
Sources: OutboxProcessingTransaction.markProcessed() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/application/OutboxProcessingTransaction.java:19</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask16" name="06a | Fence + mark PROCESSED&#10;OutboxProcessingTransaction&#10;.markProcessed()">
        <bpmn:documentation>Lock row via findByPublicIdForUpdate(). Only PROCESSING and identical OutboxAttempt may update: status=PROCESSED, processed_at=now, last_error/next_attempt_at=null. attempts and claimed_at not reset.
Sources: OutboxProcessingTransaction.markProcessed() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/application/OutboxProcessingTransaction.java:19; OutboxEvent.markProcessed() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/domain/OutboxEvent.java:90</bpmn:documentation>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_subProcess17" name="TX-OUTBOX-FAILURE | REQUIRES_NEW">
      <bpmn:documentation>Spring proxy starts this database transaction on entry. Successful return/flush commits all enclosed writes. RuntimeException or commit failure rolls back the enclosed writes. JPA SQL may be issued at flush; the diagram shows Java execution order. REQUIRED joins a caller transaction; the normal HTTP orchestration has no outer transaction.
Sources: OutboxFailureService.recordFailure() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/application/OutboxFailureService.java:20</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask18" name="06b | Fence + record failure&#10;OutboxFailureService.recordFailure()&#10;OutboxEvent.recordFailure()">
        <bpmn:documentation>Same attempt + eligible check. attempts++; sanitized last_error. Transient and attempts&lt;5: PENDING+backoff, clear claimed_at. Otherwise FAILED. Details: fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail.bpmn.
Sources: OutboxFailureService.recordFailure() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/application/OutboxFailureService.java:20; OutboxEvent.recordFailure() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/domain/OutboxEvent.java:105</bpmn:documentation>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow19" sourceRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_exclusiveGateway13" targetRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_subProcess15" name="ACK received" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow20" sourceRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_exclusiveGateway13" targetRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_subProcess17" name="Send exception" />
    <bpmn:boundaryEvent id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_boundaryEvent21" name="Result TX failure" attachedToRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_subProcess15" cancelActivity="true">
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:errorEventDefinition id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_boundaryEvent21_error" />
    </bpmn:boundaryEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow22" sourceRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_boundaryEvent21" targetRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_subProcess17" name="Record failure separately" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask23" name="Producer success ≠ History success&#10;ACK / PROCESSED does not wait&#10;for the History consumer">
      <bpmn:documentation>ACK and result UPDATE are not a distributed transaction. Crash after ACK can cause duplicate publish. Continue at fluxbank-history-consumer-detail.bpmn.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask24" name="Retry / recovery / terminal failure&#10;See transfer-recovery detail page&#10;Poller continues to the next event">
      <bpmn:documentation>Bookkeeping error is suppressed on original failure; stale recovery can later reclaim. FAILED rows remain stored, no automatic re-drive.
Sources: OutboxPoller.poll() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/application/OutboxPoller.java:32</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow25" sourceRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_subProcess15" targetRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask23" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Flow26" sourceRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_subProcess17" targetRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask24" />
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmn:process id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_broker" name="Kafka | fluxbank.transfer-events.v1" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:receiveTask id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_receiveTask27" name="TRANSFER_COMPLETED&#10;Key: transferPublicId&#10;acks=all; enable.idempotence=true">
      <bpmn:documentation>Stable key routing within partition; no account-wide/global order. App-level resends can duplicate despite producer idempotence. Topic provisioning is not application-managed.</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:receiveTask>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collaboration_fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail">
    <bpmn:documentation>05 | Outbox → Kafka publication
Source: current working tree, 2026-11-08. Documentation only; isExecutable=false. Solid arrows = local execution order. Dashed arrows = HTTP/Kafka messages across pools. Green expanded subprocess = Spring database transaction, not BPMN compensation semantics. Red = failure; amber = retry/recovery. DB visibility is by commit and SELECT, not an in-memory message. Open README.md for the source index and linked pages.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:participant id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_worker_pool" name="FluxBank | Outbox worker" processRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_worker" />
    <bpmn:participant id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_broker_pool" name="Kafka | fluxbank.transfer-events.v1" processRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_broker" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_Message28" sourceRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_serviceTask10" targetRef="fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail_receiveTask27" name="Kafka publication" />
  </bpmn:collaboration>
